# cella.policy — the crossings this task is granted.
# One grant per line: allow <direction> <ip>:<port>/<proto>
#                  or allow <direction> <ethertype>
# '*' matches any ip or any port. Everything not granted is refused.
#
# This task declares allow_internet = false, so the machine is created
# --net none: no nic, no border, and this file is never read. It is
# checked in empty on purpose — the task grants nothing, and says so.
